# Chrystal Moon Base - Licensing Declaration

**Effective Date:** May 2, 2026  
**Version:** 1.0

## 1. Introduction and Intent

Chrystal Moon Base is an open collaborative project. The primary goal is to make the fundamental concepts, designs, and knowledge freely available to the public while maintaining transparency and legal clarity.

The founder and maintainers are committed to acting with the highest standards of honesty and integrity. This document aims to eliminate any ambiguity regarding licensing.

## 2. Scope of This Declaration

This license declaration applies to all content in the GitHub repository https://github.com/ChrystalMoonBase/ChrystalMoonBase unless a specific file states otherwise.

## 3. Licensing Terms

### 3.1 Documentation, Concepts, Designs, Diagrams, Calculations and Text
All textual content, conceptual designs, technical descriptions, diagrams, calculations, and other non-software materials are licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)**.

Under this license you are free to:
- Share — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
- Adapt — remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose, including commercially

**Only requirement:** Provide appropriate credit to "Chrystal Moon Base", include a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made.

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

### 3.2 Software and Source Code
Any actual computer software, scripts, or programmable code in this repository is licensed under the **GNU General Public License Version 3 (GPL-3.0)**.

Full legal text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html (see below for the complete GPL-3.0 text)

### 3.3 Future Commercial Rights

While the core concepts and documentation will remain open source, the project reserves the right to develop and protect specific implementations, inventions, or commercial products under proprietary or commercial licenses in the future.

This means:
- Fundamental knowledge and concepts stay open.
- Specific proprietary technology, patents (if applied for), or commercial spin-offs may be developed separately to support project growth and sustainability.

No current content in this repository is under a proprietary license.

## 4. Disclaimer

All materials in this repository are provided "AS IS", without any warranties, express or implied. The project is currently in the conceptual phase. Users assume all responsibility for verifying the accuracy and feasibility of any information used.

